On applying atrophy to a target below 15% of their maximum life you will sever their lifeline, slaying them instantly. You will then feast on the remnants of their timeline for [1, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] turns, increasing your life regeneration by [29, 39, 46, 53, 59 (TL1-5; SP 100)] and causing talents without fixed cooldowns to refresh twice as fast.
